  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "凌和从三反到兴学先锋，他活成了一道不被定义的光。提到李银和很多人的第一反应是王晓波的妻子，但如果你只知道这个身份，就太小看她了。今天咱们不讲八卦，只聊这个女人的硬核人生。从一个特别的名字说起。一九五二年，这林和出生那会儿，全国正开展三反运动。他的父母是接受过新式教育的知识分子，干脆给女儿取了个小名叫三反。这名字听着有点怪，但背后藏的是态度，反的不只是运动对象，还有那些不合理的条条框框，更特别的是他们家的姓氏安排。几个姐姐随父亲姓林，李银和和三哥，却跟着母亲姓李。在那个重男轻女随复姓天经地义的年代，这种安排本身就是一种无声的反抗。可以说，李银河从出生起，就没打算活在别人的规矩里。七岁那年，他改名叫李银河，名字变了，骨子里的劲儿没变。十六岁，他去内蒙古插队，别人在那里熬日子，他却在草原上观察人，琢磨普通人在时代里的命运。那时候，他干农活，住土房，手磨出茧，但他最震撼的不是苦，而是看见人在巨大潮流里的渺小和挣扎。从那时起，他对人产生了兴趣。二十二岁，他考进大学，一开始读历史课堂上，老师讲朝代更替，他脑子里冒出的问题却越来越多。为什么有些群体会长时间陷入非理性狂热？一个人到底该怎么活才清醒？这些课本给不了答案。后来他做了一个让周围人看不懂的决定转去社会学。那时候社会学在国内刚刚起步，学科体系不完善。很多人觉得没前途，但他不在乎，毕业后进了报社。他偏偏研究起婚姻家庭和两性关系。上世纪七十年代，公开谈这些话题，光是开口都需要勇气，他却当成正经学问来做。就冲这一点，他已经比很多人超前了几十年。再说，他和王小波二十五岁那年，林和偶然读到一篇小说叫绿毛水怪，他一下被镇住了，说从来没看过有人能把故事写的这么有意思这么深。那会儿王小波还没什么名气，条件一般，长得也不符合主流审美，但李应和看的是他脑子里的东西。而王小波呢，别人觉得他研究两性是不正经，他却觉得这事很有价值，两人是奔着灵魂去的，不是奔着条件去结婚以后，他们的相处模式也很特别。李迎和三十岁那年想出国深造，王小波没有一句反对，直接说你去追你的学问，家里的事儿交给我。后来两个人在美国团聚，日子过得紧巴巴，家具都是二手淘来的，但周末泡图书馆假期到处走，一边看世界，一边聊学术。他们租的小房子，冬天冷，夏天热，但经常为了一本好书，聊到半夜。王小波写作时，李迎河帮他查资料，李银河写论文。王小波帮他梳理逻辑最动人的一件事是林和研究同性恋群体时，资料特别难搞。王小波为了帮他主动去接触相关人群，甚至想办法以圈内人身份获取信息。那个年代，光提这个词都要被议论，他这么做纯粹是因为支持妻子的学术理想。回国以后，李迎和成了中国第一个文科，博士后导师是费孝通。他开题时一口气列了十个方向，全是婚前性行为，婚外恋、单身，不婚不育。这些当时没人敢碰的题目，费老不但没拦着，还鼓励他直面真实。他跑了很多城市和乡村，跟不同年龄、不同职业的人面对面聊。很多人不愿意开口，他就一遍遍做工作。最后拿到大量一手资料，写出二十万字的中国人的性爱与婚姻。第一次把这些禁忌话题摆到了桌面上，他不光做学问，还推动改变他参与婚姻法修订的讨论，跟法学家一起为女性争取平等的财产权、离婚权等。他写女性主义，明确提出，目标是在全人类实现男女平等，反对搞对立，主张两性合作。他上奇葩大会做演讲，专门聊那些别人躲着走的话题，用数据和理性一点点拆掉大众的偏见。个人生活上，他同样不按常理出牌。王晓波去世后，他没有活成别人眼里的遗孀模板，而是和一位叫大侠的伴侣走到了一起。两人相伴二十多年，两侠文化不算高，但为人人真诚会照顾他，也愿意听他聊学术。外界议论很多。他只说感情，看的是灵魂，合不合拍，跟性别无关。从三反到李营河，从禁忌研究到性别平权，他这一辈子都在做一件事，把别人设的墙一堵一堵拆掉。他告诉我们，女人的价值不该由谁的妻子，谁的母亲来定义，你完全可以活成自己的光。如果你也被这种不被定义的人生打动，记得点个关注，带你解锁更多被刻板印象掩盖的历史人物，读懂他们藏在名气背后的真实人生。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 4050,
      "text": "凌和从三反到兴学先锋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4770,
      "end_ms": 7450,
      "text": "他活成了一道不被定义的光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00003",
      "start_ms": 8470,
      "end_ms": 14150,
      "text": "提到李银和很多人的第一反应是王晓波的妻子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00004",
      "start_ms": 14910,
      "end_ms": 17010,
      "text": "但如果你只知道这个身份，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00005",
      "start_ms": 17590,
      "end_ms": 19110,
      "text": "就太小看她了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00006",
      "start_ms": 20010,
      "end_ms": 21510,
      "text": "今天咱们不讲八卦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00007",
      "start_ms": 21510,
      "end_ms": 25350,
      "text": "只聊这个女人的硬核人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00008",
      "start_ms": 25350,
      "end_ms": 27070,
      "text": "从一个特别的名字说起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00009",
      "start_ms": 27070,
      "end_ms": 29050,
      "text": "一九五二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00010",
      "start_ms": 29050,
      "end_ms": 33540,
      "text": "这林和出生那会儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00011",
      "start_ms": 33540,
      "end_ms": 35520,
      "text": "全国正开展三反运动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35980,
      "end_ms": 39520,
      "text": "他的父母是接受过新式教育的知识分子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00013",
      "start_ms": 39520,
      "end_ms": 41740,
      "text": "干脆给女儿取了个小名叫三反。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00014",
      "start_ms": 42300,
      "end_ms": 43700,
      "text": "这名字听着有点怪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00015",
      "start_ms": 44080,
      "end_ms": 45920,
      "text": "但背后藏的是态度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00016",
      "start_ms": 46300,
      "end_ms": 48260,
      "text": "反的不只是运动对象，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00017",
      "start_ms": 48260,
      "end_ms": 50780,
      "text": "还有那些不合理的条条框框，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50780,
      "end_ms": 53820,
      "text": "更特别的是他们家的姓氏安排。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00019",
      "start_ms": 53820,
      "end_ms": 56960,
      "text": "几个姐姐随父亲姓林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00020",
      "start_ms": 57000,
      "end_ms": 58880,
      "text": "李银和和三哥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00021",
      "start_ms": 59060,
      "end_ms": 60345,
      "text": "却跟着母亲姓李。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00022",
      "start_ms": 61170,
      "end_ms": 65325,
      "text": "在那个重男轻女随复姓天经地义的年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00023",
      "start_ms": 65780,
      "end_ms": 69255,
      "text": "这种安排本身就是一种无声的反抗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00024",
      "start_ms": 70010,
      "end_ms": 70510,
      "text": "可以说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00025",
      "start_ms": 70790,
      "end_ms": 72230,
      "text": "李银河从出生起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00026",
      "start_ms": 72510,
      "end_ms": 74730,
      "text": "就没打算活在别人的规矩里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00027",
      "start_ms": 74790,
      "end_ms": 75610,
      "text": "七岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00028",
      "start_ms": 75830,
      "end_ms": 77225,
      "text": "他改名叫李银河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00029",
      "start_ms": 77740,
      "end_ms": 78565,
      "text": "名字变了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00030",
      "start_ms": 78960,
      "end_ms": 80155,
      "text": "骨子里的劲儿没变。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00031",
      "start_ms": 80730,
      "end_ms": 81405,
      "text": "十六岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00032",
      "start_ms": 81790,
      "end_ms": 83075,
      "text": "他去内蒙古插队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00033",
      "start_ms": 83410,
      "end_ms": 85015,
      "text": "别人在那里熬日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00034",
      "start_ms": 85280,
      "end_ms": 87085,
      "text": "他却在草原上观察人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00035",
      "start_ms": 87650,
      "end_ms": 89745,
      "text": "琢磨普通人在时代里的命运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00036",
      "start_ms": 90210,
      "end_ms": 90730,
      "text": "那时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00037",
      "start_ms": 90730,
      "end_ms": 91585,
      "text": "他干农活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00038",
      "start_ms": 91950,
      "end_ms": 92570,
      "text": "住土房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00039",
      "start_ms": 92950,
      "end_ms": 93875,
      "text": "手磨出茧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00040",
      "start_ms": 94730,
      "end_ms": 96605,
      "text": "但他最震撼的不是苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00041",
      "start_ms": 97100,
      "end_ms": 100905,
      "text": "而是看见人在巨大潮流里的渺小和挣扎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00042",
      "start_ms": 101460,
      "end_ms": 102465,
      "text": "从那时起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00043",
      "start_ms": 102800,
      "end_ms": 104535,
      "text": "他对人产生了兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00044",
      "start_ms": 105150,
      "end_ms": 105930,
      "text": "二十二岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00045",
      "start_ms": 106150,
      "end_ms": 107270,
      "text": "他考进大学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00046",
      "start_ms": 107630,
      "end_ms": 109600,
      "text": "一开始读历史课堂上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00047",
      "start_ms": 109600,
      "end_ms": 111215,
      "text": "老师讲朝代更替，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00048",
      "start_ms": 111680,
      "end_ms": 114255,
      "text": "他脑子里冒出的问题却越来越多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00049",
      "start_ms": 115180,
      "end_ms": 119675,
      "text": "为什么有些群体会长时间陷入非理性狂热？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00050",
      "start_ms": 120270,
      "end_ms": 122710,
      "text": "一个人到底该怎么活才清醒？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00051",
      "start_ms": 123310,
      "end_ms": 124870,
      "text": "这些课本给不了答案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00052",
      "start_ms": 125050,
      "end_ms": 128930,
      "text": "后来他做了一个让周围人看不懂的决定转去社会学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00053",
      "start_ms": 129490,
      "end_ms": 131810,
      "text": "那时候社会学在国内刚刚起步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00054",
      "start_ms": 132170,
      "end_ms": 133710,
      "text": "学科体系不完善。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00055",
      "start_ms": 134190,
      "end_ms": 135690,
      "text": "很多人觉得没前途，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00056",
      "start_ms": 136350,
      "end_ms": 137310,
      "text": "但他不在乎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00057",
      "start_ms": 138270,
      "end_ms": 139530,
      "text": "毕业后进了报社。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00058",
      "start_ms": 140190,
      "end_ms": 144250,
      "text": "他偏偏研究起婚姻家庭和两性关系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00059",
      "start_ms": 144470,
      "end_ms": 145930,
      "text": "上世纪七十年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00060",
      "start_ms": 146170,
      "end_ms": 147790,
      "text": "公开谈这些话题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00061",
      "start_ms": 148390,
      "end_ms": 150700,
      "text": "光是开口都需要勇气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00062",
      "start_ms": 151120,
      "end_ms": 153200,
      "text": "他却当成正经学问来做。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00063",
      "start_ms": 153860,
      "end_ms": 154880,
      "text": "就冲这一点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00064",
      "start_ms": 155180,
      "end_ms": 157700,
      "text": "他已经比很多人超前了几十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00065",
      "start_ms": 158280,
      "end_ms": 158580,
      "text": "再说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00066",
      "start_ms": 158580,
      "end_ms": 161340,
      "text": "他和王小波二十五岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00067",
      "start_ms": 161980,
      "end_ms": 166540,
      "text": "林和偶然读到一篇小说叫绿毛水怪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00068",
      "start_ms": 167320,
      "end_ms": 169120,
      "text": "他一下被镇住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00069",
      "start_ms": 169540,
      "end_ms": 174260,
      "text": "说从来没看过有人能把故事写的这么有意思这么深。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00070",
      "start_ms": 174800,
      "end_ms": 176720,
      "text": "那会儿王小波还没什么名气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00071",
      "start_ms": 177100,
      "end_ms": 177980,
      "text": "条件一般，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00072",
      "start_ms": 178200,
      "end_ms": 179895,
      "text": "长得也不符合主流审美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00073",
      "start_ms": 180070,
      "end_ms": 182455,
      "text": "但李应和看的是他脑子里的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00074",
      "start_ms": 183270,
      "end_ms": 184275,
      "text": "而王小波呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00075",
      "start_ms": 184580,
      "end_ms": 186655,
      "text": "别人觉得他研究两性是不正经，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00076",
      "start_ms": 187290,
      "end_ms": 188875,
      "text": "他却觉得这事很有价值，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00077",
      "start_ms": 189800,
      "end_ms": 191695,
      "text": "两人是奔着灵魂去的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00078",
      "start_ms": 192220,
      "end_ms": 195735,
      "text": "不是奔着条件去结婚以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00079",
      "start_ms": 196180,
      "end_ms": 198635,
      "text": "他们的相处模式也很特别。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00080",
      "start_ms": 199580,
      "end_ms": 202365,
      "text": "李迎和三十岁那年想出国深造，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00081",
      "start_ms": 203120,
      "end_ms": 204935,
      "text": "王小波没有一句反对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00082",
      "start_ms": 206050,
      "end_ms": 208470,
      "text": "直接说你去追你的学问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00083",
      "start_ms": 208750,
      "end_ms": 210465,
      "text": "家里的事儿交给我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00084",
      "start_ms": 210880,
      "end_ms": 212545,
      "text": "后来两个人在美国团聚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00085",
      "start_ms": 212950,
      "end_ms": 214225,
      "text": "日子过得紧巴巴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00086",
      "start_ms": 214660,
      "end_ms": 216480,
      "text": "家具都是二手淘来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00087",
      "start_ms": 216480,
      "end_ms": 219545,
      "text": "但周末泡图书馆假期到处走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00088",
      "start_ms": 219970,
      "end_ms": 220990,
      "text": "一边看世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00089",
      "start_ms": 220990,
      "end_ms": 222145,
      "text": "一边聊学术。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00090",
      "start_ms": 222770,
      "end_ms": 224285,
      "text": "他们租的小房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00091",
      "start_ms": 224600,
      "end_ms": 225325,
      "text": "冬天冷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00092",
      "start_ms": 225650,
      "end_ms": 226315,
      "text": "夏天热，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00093",
      "start_ms": 226770,
      "end_ms": 228670,
      "text": "但经常为了一本好书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00094",
      "start_ms": 229010,
      "end_ms": 229845,
      "text": "聊到半夜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00095",
      "start_ms": 230440,
      "end_ms": 231805,
      "text": "王小波写作时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00096",
      "start_ms": 232140,
      "end_ms": 233700,
      "text": "李迎河帮他查资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00097",
      "start_ms": 233920,
      "end_ms": 235085,
      "text": "李银河写论文。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00098",
      "start_ms": 235570,
      "end_ms": 242135,
      "text": "王小波帮他梳理逻辑最动人的一件事是林和研究同性恋群体时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00099",
      "start_ms": 242700,
      "end_ms": 243715,
      "text": "资料特别难搞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00100",
      "start_ms": 244040,
      "end_ms": 248865,
      "text": "王小波为了帮他主动去接触相关人群，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00101",
      "start_ms": 249300,
      "end_ms": 252525,
      "text": "甚至想办法以圈内人身份获取信息。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00102",
      "start_ms": 252770,
      "end_ms": 253435,
      "text": "那个年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00103",
      "start_ms": 253800,
      "end_ms": 255635,
      "text": "光提这个词都要被议论，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00104",
      "start_ms": 256520,
      "end_ms": 261345,
      "text": "他这么做纯粹是因为支持妻子的学术理想。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00105",
      "start_ms": 262320,
      "end_ms": 263235,
      "text": "回国以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00106",
      "start_ms": 263900,
      "end_ms": 266870,
      "text": "李迎和成了中国第一个文科，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00107",
      "start_ms": 266870,
      "end_ms": 269225,
      "text": "博士后导师是费孝通。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00108",
      "start_ms": 269630,
      "end_ms": 272495,
      "text": "他开题时一口气列了十个方向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00109",
      "start_ms": 272950,
      "end_ms": 274495,
      "text": "全是婚前性行为，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00110",
      "start_ms": 275230,
      "end_ms": 276695,
      "text": "婚外恋、单身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00111",
      "start_ms": 276990,
      "end_ms": 277790,
      "text": "不婚不育。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00112",
      "start_ms": 277950,
      "end_ms": 280185,
      "text": "这些当时没人敢碰的题目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00113",
      "start_ms": 280920,
      "end_ms": 282195,
      "text": "费老不但没拦着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00114",
      "start_ms": 282730,
      "end_ms": 284855,
      "text": "还鼓励他直面真实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00115",
      "start_ms": 285730,
      "end_ms": 287925,
      "text": "他跑了很多城市和乡村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00116",
      "start_ms": 288840,
      "end_ms": 293490,
      "text": "跟不同年龄、不同职业的人面对面聊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00117",
      "start_ms": 293570,
      "end_ms": 294885,
      "text": "很多人不愿意开口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00118",
      "start_ms": 295190,
      "end_ms": 296825,
      "text": "他就一遍遍做工作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00119",
      "start_ms": 297590,
      "end_ms": 299610,
      "text": "最后拿到大量一手资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00120",
      "start_ms": 299850,
      "end_ms": 303270,
      "text": "写出二十万字的中国人的性爱与婚姻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00121",
      "start_ms": 304250,
      "end_ms": 307390,
      "text": "第一次把这些禁忌话题摆到了桌面上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00122",
      "start_ms": 307750,
      "end_ms": 309010,
      "text": "他不光做学问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00123",
      "start_ms": 309210,
      "end_ms": 313190,
      "text": "还推动改变他参与婚姻法修订的讨论，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00124",
      "start_ms": 313470,
      "end_ms": 319230,
      "text": "跟法学家一起为女性争取平等的财产权、离婚权等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00125",
      "start_ms": 319490,
      "end_ms": 320730,
      "text": "他写女性主义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00126",
      "start_ms": 321150,
      "end_ms": 322170,
      "text": "明确提出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00127",
      "start_ms": 322530,
      "end_ms": 326370,
      "text": "目标是在全人类实现男女平等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00128",
      "start_ms": 326730,
      "end_ms": 328320,
      "text": "反对搞对立，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00129",
      "start_ms": 328680,
      "end_ms": 330280,
      "text": "主张两性合作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00130",
      "start_ms": 330340,
      "end_ms": 332380,
      "text": "他上奇葩大会做演讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00131",
      "start_ms": 332780,
      "end_ms": 335380,
      "text": "专门聊那些别人躲着走的话题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00132",
      "start_ms": 335780,
      "end_ms": 340220,
      "text": "用数据和理性一点点拆掉大众的偏见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00133",
      "start_ms": 341020,
      "end_ms": 342080,
      "text": "个人生活上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00134",
      "start_ms": 342300,
      "end_ms": 344280,
      "text": "他同样不按常理出牌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00135",
      "start_ms": 344980,
      "end_ms": 346200,
      "text": "王晓波去世后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00136",
      "start_ms": 346360,
      "end_ms": 349200,
      "text": "他没有活成别人眼里的遗孀模板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00137",
      "start_ms": 349580,
      "end_ms": 352360,
      "text": "而是和一位叫大侠的伴侣走到了一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00138",
      "start_ms": 352760,
      "end_ms": 354220,
      "text": "两人相伴二十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00139",
      "start_ms": 354980,
      "end_ms": 356320,
      "text": "两侠文化不算高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00140",
      "start_ms": 356720,
      "end_ms": 359205,
      "text": "但为人人真诚会照顾他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00141",
      "start_ms": 359570,
      "end_ms": 361035,
      "text": "也愿意听他聊学术。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00142",
      "start_ms": 361650,
      "end_ms": 362915,
      "text": "外界议论很多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00143",
      "start_ms": 363320,
      "end_ms": 364440,
      "text": "他只说感情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00144",
      "start_ms": 364440,
      "end_ms": 365320,
      "text": "看的是灵魂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00145",
      "start_ms": 365320,
      "end_ms": 366020,
      "text": "合不合拍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00146",
      "start_ms": 366300,
      "end_ms": 367585,
      "text": "跟性别无关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00147",
      "start_ms": 368100,
      "end_ms": 369855,
      "text": "从三反到李营河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00148",
      "start_ms": 370220,
      "end_ms": 372655,
      "text": "从禁忌研究到性别平权，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00149",
      "start_ms": 373260,
      "end_ms": 375720,
      "text": "他这一辈子都在做一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00150",
      "start_ms": 376140,
      "end_ms": 379370,
      "text": "把别人设的墙一堵一堵拆掉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00151",
      "start_ms": 379590,
      "end_ms": 380555,
      "text": "他告诉我们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00152",
      "start_ms": 380840,
      "end_ms": 383830,
      "text": "女人的价值不该由谁的妻子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00153",
      "start_ms": 383910,
      "end_ms": 385435,
      "text": "谁的母亲来定义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00154",
      "start_ms": 385990,
      "end_ms": 388205,
      "text": "你完全可以活成自己的光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00155",
      "start_ms": 388820,
      "end_ms": 391915,
      "text": "如果你也被这种不被定义的人生打动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00156",
      "start_ms": 392460,
      "end_ms": 393585,
      "text": "记得点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00157",
      "start_ms": 394430,
      "end_ms": 398970,
      "text": "带你解锁更多被刻板印象掩盖的历史人物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb3d5396705c9094_s00158",
      "start_ms": 398970,
      "end_ms": 402495,
      "text": "读懂他们藏在名气背后的真实人生。"
    }
  ],
